{{Passive skill box|Heartstopper}}

'''Heartstopper''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Trickster]] that grants less damage from hits for 5 seconds, and then from [[damage over time]] for 5 seconds, alternating between the two.

This does not apply to over-time loss effects such as {{il|Petrified Blood}} or {{il|Essence Drain of Desperation}}, which are not considered [[damage]].

